  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 205.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this part is to accommodate those situations where strict adherence to the rules would not be in the best interest of the public.\n\nSource. #6506-B, eff 5-1-97; ss by #8128, eff 7-28-04; ss by #10187, eff 9-25-12; ss by #13491, eff 11-19-22",
